      "title": "[P2] Retry restores after duplicate live-result delivery",
      "body": "When a host emits the same non-empty result through both `toolresult` and `openai:set_globals` before the restore RPC settles, the second delivery increments `dataRevision` but joins this existing promise. The promise then rejects its response because the revision changed, and both callers receive `false`, so saved pagination/disclosure state is never applied or persisted. Avoid incrementing the revision for duplicate data or queue another restore after an invalidated joined request.",
